{"id":"n84598-1-8","stage":5,"title":"하체 · 下体","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84598-1-8-1","ko":"이 운동은 어디에 좋아요?","zh":"这项运动对哪里有好处呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"운동은","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운동은","audio":"/audio/b8c9c2430416ec2bf5b5.mp3"}},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디에","audio":"/audio/c24ae324e24a5ebc5c5e.mp3"}},{"text":"좋아요?","meaning":"好，有益，有效","explanation":"좋다：好，有益，有效；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"14","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아요","audio":"/audio/4e89f12afd275d8a286b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"d697e1a44df5b675","term":"운동","zh":"运动","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3","entryId":"69521","definition":"锻炼身体或为了健康而活动身体。","pronunciation":["운ː동"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，有益，有效","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"具有使身体或健康变得更好的性质。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/166ba162672caa6e7518.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n84598-1-8-2","ko":"하체의 근육을 튼튼하게 하는 데에 좋은 운동이지요.","zh":"这是对增强下肢肌肉很有帮助的运动哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"하체의","meaning":"下体，下身","explanation":"하체：下体，下身；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"하체","audio":"/audio/781bd7f0fdffa94b426a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84598","senseId":"1","lemma":"하체","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하체의","audio":"/audio/0f7b5c7265f649e1c22d.mp3"}},{"text":"근육을","meaning":"肌肉","explanation":"근육：肌肉；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"근육","audio":"/audio/ab5f451d39c3167437d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37191","senseId":"1","lemma":"근육","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"근육을","audio":"/audio/c93573b40af892a80ca7.mp3"}},{"text":"튼튼하게","meaning":"强壮，坚固","explanation":"튼튼하다：强壮，坚固；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"튼튼하다","audio":"/audio/646fa517b1e63fe66868.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71480","senseId":"2","lemma":"튼튼하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"튼튼하게","audio":"/audio/82244ecdf50515fbd921.mp3"}},{"text":"하는","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는","audio":"/audio/db405bc1ba8346522533.mp3"}},{"text":"데에","meaning":"情况，状况。","explanation":"데：情况，状况；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"데","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47455","senseId":"3","lemma":"데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"데에","audio":"/audio/07f056ccb1969aa9caa8.mp3"}},{"text":"좋은","meaning":"好，有益，有效","explanation":"좋다：好，有益，有效；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"14","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋은","audio":"/audio/dc3caaaf06a600dc6306.mp3"}},{"text":"운동이지요.","meaning":"运动","explanation":"운동：运动；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；지요：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"운동","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69521","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운동이지요","audio":"/audio/fbc9798d5dfc23d5ca91.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"781bd7f0fdffa94b","term":"하체","zh":"下体，下身","audio":"/audio/781bd7f0fdffa94b426a.mp3","entryId":"84598","definition":"人体或物体的下面部分。","pronunciation":["하ː체"]},{"id":"ab5f451d39c31674","term":"근육","zh":"肌肉","audio":"/audio/ab5f451d39c3167437d6.mp3","entryId":"37191","definition":"使人或动物的身体得以活动的筋和肉。","pronunciation":["그뉵"]},{"id":"646fa517b1e63fe6","term":"튼튼하다","zh":"强壮，坚固","audio":"/audio/646fa517b1e63fe66868.mp3","entryId":"71480","definition":"人的身体或骨骼牙齿等结实或健康。","pronunciation":["튼튼하다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"16cb0f76ae2e2fc7","term":"데","zh":"情况，状况。","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3","entryId":"47455","definition":"情况，状况。","pronunciation":["데"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，有益，有效","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"具有使身体或健康变得更好的性质。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"d697e1a44df5b675","term":"운동","zh":"运动","audio":"/audio/d697e1a44df5b675b505.mp3","entryId":"69521","definition":"锻炼身体或为了健康而活动身体。","pronunciation":["운ː동"]}],"audio":"/audio/7219cea2b7e2b6b46298.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.191,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=84598","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典"